{"id":12510,"shortDescription":"¡Mano dura! Toma las riendas de una prisión privada. Eres el responsable del cuidado, la custodia y el control de individuos que han sido arrestados. Comienza con una prisión de baja seguridad y constrúyela en una SuperMax. Desde construcción hasta operaciones diarias, debes proteger a la sociedad mientras consigues beneficios.","developers":["Gamebryo","Virtual Playground"],"publishers":["Cosmi Valusoft"],"categories":["Un jugador","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"29 ENE 2008","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/12510?t=1591334569","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/12510/0000003430.600x338.jpg?t=1591334569","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/12510/0000003430.1920x1080.jpg?t=1591334569"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/12510/0000003431.600x338.jpg?t=1591334569","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/12510/0000003431.1920x1080.jpg?t=1591334569"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/12510/0000003432.600x338.jpg?t=1591334569","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/12510/0000003432.1920x1080.jpg?t=1591334569"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/12510/0000003433.600x338.jpg?t=1591334569","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/12510/0000003433.1920x1080.jpg?t=1591334569"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/12510/0000003434.600x338.jpg?t=1591334569","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/12510/0000003434.1920x1080.jpg?t=1591334569"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/12510/0000003435.600x338.jpg?t=1591334569","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamst